erin_cs: BrightWave reporting intermittent 401s then 429s after integrating our web SDK. Happens on staging and prod.
dan_engineer: Any logs or HAR? which endpoints?
erin_cs: Mostly POST /v1/generate and some embed requests. Multiple tabs amplify it.
raj_support: Pulled server logs: same IPs, alternating OK/401 for same session. Shortly after, lots of client retries -> 429 from the edge.
tom_infra: They said their CDN has session affinity and also rotates a signed SSO cookie and keys every 6 hours. Could be stale cookie hitting rotated backend instance.
dan_engineer: Likely cause: CDN cached old key/session; hitting a backend with rotated key -> validation fails -> 401. Concurrent tab retries cause fanout -> 429.
raj_support: Confirmed different backend instance IDs show mismatched key versions.
erin_cs: Customer wants minimal code change to ship today. Preferred not to touch CDN config.
dan_engineer: Client-side mitigations: 1) SDK init: call /v1/keys/validate once to confirm token validity before regular requests. 2) Use a tab-level mutex so only one tab attempts token refresh at a time to avoid stampedes.
raj_support: Small mutex snippet we use: 
// tab-lock via localStorage
async function oneTabRefresh(key, refreshFn){
  const lockKey = 'rw:refresh:lock';
  const start = Date.now();
  while(localStorage.getItem(lockKey) && Date.now()-start < 3000) await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,100));
  if(!localStorage.getItem(lockKey)){
    localStorage.setItem(lockKey, String(Date.now()));
    try { return await refreshFn(); } finally { localStorage.removeItem(lockKey); }
  } else {
    await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,500));
    return getStoredKey();
  }
}
dan_engineer: Also add jittered exponential backoff: delay = base * 2**attempts * (0.5+Math.random()/2), cap 30s.
tom_infra: Short-term ask: purge CDN edge and force cookie/key re-issue. Use curl to validate current key: curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $THE_KEY" https://api.redwood.inference/v1/keys/validate (returns 200 if valid).
erin_cs: I'll send the mutex + backoff + curl test. Schedule a brief watch while they apply.
session-bot: [ticket] BW-4512 created for BrightWave assigned to raj_support P2.
raj_support: Updated their ticket with snippets and next steps.
erin_cs: Thanks, booking a 20 min sync later today to observe logs during patch.
